{"name":"Shell Walk","hex":"#b6b6a8","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"shell","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A hard external covering of an animal.","Any mollusk having such a covering."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To remove the outer covering or shell of something.","To bombard, to fire projectiles at, especially with artillery."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/shell"},{"term":"walk","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To move on the feet by alternately setting each foot (or pair or group of feet: in the case of some non-human animals with four or more feet) forward, with at least one foot on the ground at all times. Compare run.","To \"walk free\", i.e. to win, or avoid, a criminal court case, particularly when actually guilty."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A trip made by walking.","A distance walked."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/walk"}],"entries":[{"title":"Shell (2024 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Shell is a 2024 American black comedy body horror film directed by Max Minghella, written by Jack Stanley, and starring Elisabeth Moss, Kate Hudson, Kaia Gerber and Elizabeth Berkley."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/ee/Shell_2024_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shell_(2024_film)","wikidata":"Q124214428"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/ee/Shell_2024_poster.jpg/250px-Shell_2024_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/ee/Shell_2024_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/ee/Shell_2024_poster.jpg/250px-Shell_2024_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.